@startuml
' Artifact: CapsuleAI Data View
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft; Presentation refactor: 2026-10-11.
' Purpose: Simple logical data ownership overview; concepts are NOT physical tables.
' Primary Sources: SRS v0.3; Business Rules v0.1.2; ADD v0.1.4;
' Selected Architecture Decisions v0.1.5 (ADA-001-018 unchanged);
' accepted Logical, Implementation and Deployment Views v0.1.
' Process: Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 4.3/24/40/42/46.
' Scope: ownership, major information relationships and conceptual stores; no schema/API design.
'
' Grouped labels summarize related concepts, not merged entities or policies:
' Identity retains distinct account/session/reset authority (ADD 9.1; SRS 3.1.1).
' Profile includes declared needs/preferences and selected location; request/environment inputs
' remain distinct (SRS 3.2/3.3; Logical View's Personal Context and UC-006 authority).
' Garment includes its confirmed profile; readiness remains derived Wardrobe policy, not ownership
' or a second garment (DATA-GAR-001-005; BRULE-GAR-001-003; ADD 9.5).
' Advice and utilization/effective evidence are separate derived meanings under the same owner
' (SRS 3.7-3.13; ADD 9.2/9.7); Feedback never implies Wear.
' Outfit/Evaluation groups representation and owner-controlled published policy; Intelligence's
' reference consumes ONLY the policy, never a private Outfit entity or Daily's displayed subset.
' Assessment Basis governs complete same-basis Coverage/Multiplier meaning and hypothetical
' previews; five result states and incremental unique-set utility remain in ADD 9.7 / DATA-ANL-004.
' Coverage/Gaps remain distinct contextual assessments/capability needs; Candidate/Preview remain
' distinct hypothetical meanings (BRULE-COV/GAP/MULT); Shopping retains optional qualified commerce.
' Weather/commercial evidence denotes separate sources, not one provider; each owner translates it.
' Accepted media associations, minimal history, logical-action outcomes and required resumable
' work remain owner-held in ONE PostgreSQL (ADD 8.4/9.2/9.3/9.9; accepted views).
' Measurement retains its own work and optional unlinked aggregates (FR-MET-001-007/DATA-RET-003);
' its representative fact arrow does not transfer business authority or erase other measured facts.
' Detailed lifecycle, authorization, correction/retry/time and source-freshness rules stay in
' SRS / Business Rules / ADD; this refactor removes no rule from those authoritative homes.
' Draft/evidence/result persistence, physical references/transactions and cleanup realization remain
' unresolved detailed design (ADD 9.2-9.9); no shared action/work entity or new decision is selected.
' Next: Data View review -> ADRs.

title CapsuleAI - Data Ownership Overview\nData View v0.1 | Baseline Draft
allowmixing
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam classBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam packageBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam noteFontSize 13
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam legendFontSize 13

package "Identity" as Identity #EFF6FF {
    class "Account / Session / Reset" as Access #DCFCE7
}

package "Personal Context" as Context #F0FDFA {
    class "Profile / Selected Location\nNeeds / preferences" as Profile #DCFCE7
    class "Current Context\nRequest / translated environment" as CurrentContext #DBEAFE
    Profile --> CurrentContext : declared inputs
}

package "Wardrobe" as Wardrobe #F0FDF4 {
    class "Garment\nConfirmed profile" as Garment #DCFCE7
    class "AI Proposal / Review Draft\nPython output; unconfirmed" as Draft #E2E8F0
    class "Media Reference" as MediaReference #DCFCE7
    Draft --> Garment : user confirmation / correction
    Garment --> MediaReference : optional media
}

package "Outfit Advice and Use" as Outfits #FFFBEB {
    class "Outfit Evaluation Semantics\nOutfit identity / hard validity" as Evaluation #DBEAFE
    class "Daily / Shuffle Advice\nUtilization / effective evidence" as Advice #FEF3C7
    class "Feedback (Like / Dislike)" as Feedback #DCFCE7
    class "Wear Event" as Wear #DCFCE7
    class "Minimal History" as History #DBEAFE
    Advice -up-> Evaluation
    Feedback -up-> Evaluation : outfit target
    Wear -up-> Evaluation : reported outfit
    Wear -down-> History
    Feedback -[hidden]right-> Wear
}

package "Wardrobe Intelligence" as Intelligence #F5F3FF {
    class "Assessment Basis" as Basis #FEF3C7
    class "Coverage / Gaps" as Coverage #FEF3C7
    class "Candidate Garment / Preview\nHypothetical" as Hypothetical #EDE9FE
    class "Multiplier Assessment" as Multiplier #FEF3C7
    class "Shopping Recommendation" as Shopping #FEF3C7
    Basis -down-> Coverage
    Basis -down-> Multiplier : same basis
    Coverage -down-> Hypothetical : candidate needs
    Multiplier -down-> Hypothetical : candidate / new outfits
    Multiplier -down-> Shopping : supported utility
}

package "Product Measurement" as Measurement #FDF2F8 {
    class "Interaction Evidence" as Evidence #FCE7F3
}

class "External Evidence\nWeather / commercial" as ExternalEvidence #E2E8F0
database "ONE PostgreSQL\nPrimary store" as DB #E2E8F0
storage "Private Object Storage" as Media #E2E8F0

' Arrows show conceptual meaning, not runtime calls, SQL joins or execution order.
' Cross-owner arrows reference published identities/values/policy, not private entities or writes.
Basis -[dashed]right-> Evaluation : shared policy only
ExternalEvidence -[dashed]-> CurrentContext : translated weather
ExternalEvidence -[dashed]-> Shopping : optional commerce
Wear ..[#BE185D]> Evidence : independent measurement
MediaReference --> Media : private media

' Layout aids only; they introduce no information or ownership relationship.
Access -[hidden]down-> Profile
CurrentContext -[hidden]down-> Basis
MediaReference -[hidden]down-> Evaluation
History -[hidden]down-> DB
Evidence -[hidden]down-> DB
Media -[hidden]down-> DB

note as Boundaries
  All owners retain necessary state in ONE PostgreSQL.
  Derived / input information does not imply permanent storage.
  Hypothetical previews create no ownership, purchase or Wear.
  History preserves past meaning, never current ownership.
  Published Wardrobe / Context inform Advice and Intelligence.
  Lifecycle / authority / retention: SRS, Business Rules and ADD.
end note
DB -[hidden]down-> Boundaries

legend bottom
  |<#DCFCE7> Authoritative |<#FEF3C7> Derived / evaluated |<#EDE9FE> Hypothetical |
  |<#DBEAFE> History / reference / input |<#E2E8F0> Unconfirmed / external evidence / resource |<#FCE7F3> Measurement |
  Boxes represent logical information concepts, not database tables.
endlegend
@enduml
